{"sha": "7f9a9735665188a4855fb1922ee37c57fed31e83123d3f9f1613b5e9fb2c6511", "body": ["\\begin{proposition}[$0$ 处的标准展开式]", "当 $x \\to 0$ 时，对每个固定的阶数 $n$：", "\\index{泰勒展开!标准}", "\\begin{align*}", "\\eu^x &= 1 + x + \\frac{x^2}{2!} + \\dots + \\frac{x^n}{n!} + o(x^n),\\\\", "\\cos x &= 1 - \\frac{x^2}{2!} + \\frac{x^4}{4!} - \\dots", "+ \\frac{(-1)^p x^{2p}}{(2p)!} + o(x^{2p+1}),\\\\", "\\sin x &= x - \\frac{x^3}{3!} + \\dots + \\frac{(-1)^p", "x^{2p+1}}{(2p+1)!} + o(x^{2p+2}),\\\\", "\\frac{1}{1 - x} &= 1 + x + x^2 + \\dots + x^n + o(x^n),\\\\", "\\ln(1 + x) &= x - \\frac{x^2}{2} + \\frac{x^3}{3} - \\dots +", "\\frac{(-1)^{n-1} x^n}{n} + o(x^n),\\\\", "(1 + x)^\\alpha &= 1 + \\alpha x + \\frac{\\alpha(\\alpha-1)}{2!}x^2 +", "\\dots + \\binom{\\alpha}{n} x^n + o(x^n),", "\\end{align*}", "其中 $\\binom{\\alpha}{n} = \\frac{\\alpha(\\alpha - 1)\\cdots(\\alpha - n", "+ 1)}{n!}$ 对实数 $\\alpha$ 成立。（$\\cosh$ 与 $\\sinh$ 的展开式，分别与 $\\cos$、", "$\\sin$ 相同，只是去掉交替符号。）", "\\label{prop:b1:taylor:standard}", "\\end{proposition}", "", "\\begin{proof}", "各函数在 $0$ 附近光滑，其导数易于计算：", "$(\\eu^x)^{(k)} = \\eu^x$；$\\sin$ 与 $\\cos$ 的导数", "以 $4$ 为周期循环；$\\bigl((1+x)^\\alpha\\bigr)^{(k)} = \\alpha(\\alpha -", "1)\\cdots(\\alpha - k + 1)(1+x)^{\\alpha - k}$；", "$\\bigl(\\ln(1+x)\\bigr)^{(k)} = \\frac{(-1)^{k-1}(k-1)!}{(1+x)^k}$。", "在 $a = 0$ 处应用泰勒–杨公式。（几何级数的情形是精确的：", "$\\frac{1}{1-x} - \\sum_0^n x^k = \\frac{x^{n+1}}{1 - x} = o(x^n)$。）", "\\end{proof}", "", "\\begin{method}[利用展开式计算]\\label{met:b1:taylor:compute}", "\\begin{enumerate}", "  \\item \\emph{先确定目标阶数} $n$，并将每个中间结果都截断到该阶", "        --- 保留更高阶的项是白费功夫，", "        丢掉低阶的项则是错误。", "  \\item \\emph{和与积}：将每个因子展开到 $n$ 阶，", "        相乘后舍去高于 $x^n$ 的项。", "  \\item \\emph{复合} $f(u(x))$，其中 $u(x) \\to 0$：", "        把 $u$ 的展开式代入 $f$ 的展开式，逐阶进行。", "  \\item \\emph{商}：写成 $\\frac{1}{1 + v}$，其中 $v \\to 0$，", "        并利用几何级数的展开式。", "  \\item \\emph{逐项积分}展开式（求导需要更加小心 --- 理由：", "        $o(t^n)$ 从 $0$ 到 $x$ 的积分", "        为 $o(x^{n+1})$，可直接放缩得到）。", "\\end{enumerate}", "\\end{method}", "", "\\begin{example}[复合，并列出逐阶计算]\\label{ex:b1:taylor:esin}", "将 $\\eu^{\\sin x}$ 展开到 $3$ 阶。内层函数为 $u = \\sin x", "= x - \\frac{x^3}{6} + o(x^3)$，它确实趋于 $0$。外层函数为", "$\\eu^u = 1 + u + \\frac{u^2}{2} + \\frac{u^3}{6} + o(u^3)$，并且", "$o(u^3) = o(x^3)$，因为 $u \\sim x$。取 $u$ 的各次幂，并截断到", "$x^3$ 为止：", "\\[", "u^2 = x^2 + o(x^3), \\qquad u^3 = x^3 + o(x^3)", "\\]", "（交叉项 $2x\\cdot(-\\frac{x^3}{6})$ 已是 $x^4$ 阶。）", "合并：", "\\[", "\\eu^{\\sin x} = 1 + \\Bigl(x - \\frac{x^3}{6}\\Bigr) + \\frac{x^2}{2}", "+ \\frac{x^3}{6} + o(x^3)", "= 1 + x + \\frac{x^2}{2} + o(x^3) :", "\\]", "两个 $x^3$ 的贡献恰好抵消。最后值得注意的是：", "$\\eu^{\\sin x}$ 与 $\\eu^x$ 直到 $3$ 阶都相同 --- 并非", "由于 $\\sin x \\approx x$ 只是粗略的近似，而是因为", "指数的第一处不一致（$-\\frac{x^3}{6}$）进入，", "以 $\\eu^0 = 1$ 为因子，随后与外层指数的三次项", "相遇；逐阶的计算能够发现这类巧合，", "而目测从来做不到。（下一项为", "$-\\frac{x^4}{8}$，这种一致在 $4$ 阶即告结束。）", "\\end{example}", "", "\\begin{example}\\label{ex:b1:taylor:tan}", "求 $\\tan$ 的 $5$ 阶展开。写 $\\tan x =", "\\sin x \\cdot \\frac{1}{\\cos x}$：", "\\[", "\\frac{1}{\\cos x} = \\frac{1}{1 - \\bigl(\\frac{x^2}{2} - \\frac{x^4}{24}", "+ o(x^5)\\bigr)}", "= 1 + \\Bigl(\\frac{x^2}{2} - \\frac{x^4}{24}\\Bigr)", "+ \\Bigl(\\frac{x^2}{2}\\Bigr)^{\\!2} + o(x^5)", "= 1 + \\frac{x^2}{2} + \\frac{5x^4}{24} + o(x^5),", "\\]", "于是", "\\[", "\\tan x = \\Bigl(x - \\frac{x^3}{6} + \\frac{x^5}{120}\\Bigr)", "\\Bigl(1 + \\frac{x^2}{2} + \\frac{5x^4}{24}\\Bigr) + o(x^5)", "= x + \\frac{x^3}{3} + \\frac{2x^5}{15} + o(x^5) .", "\\]", "\\end{example}", "", "\\begin{omfigure}", "\\begin{tikzpicture}[x=1.15cm, y=1.05cm]", "  \\draw[-Stealth] (-3.5,0) -- (3.6,0) node[below, font=\\small]", "    {$x$};", "  \\draw[-Stealth] (0,-2.15) -- (0,2.2);", "  \\draw (3.1416,-0.05) -- (3.1416,0.05)", "    node[below=3pt, font=\\small] {$\\pi$};", "  \\draw (-3.1416,-0.05) -- (-3.1416,0.05)", "    node[below=3pt, font=\\small] {$-\\pi$};", "  \\draw (-0.05,1) -- (0.05,1) node[above left, font=\\small,", "    inner sep=1pt] {$1$};", "  \\draw (-0.05,-1) -- (0.05,-1) node[below right, font=\\small,", "    inner sep=1pt] {$-1$};", "  \\draw[omThm, very thick, smooth]", "    plot[domain=-3.3:3.3, samples=120] (\\x, {sin(\\x r)});", "  \\draw[omDef, thick]", "    plot[domain=-2.0:2.0] (\\x, \\x)", "    node[right, font=\\small] {$T_1$};", "  \\draw[omDef, thick, dashed, smooth]", "    plot[domain=-2.7:2.7, samples=80] (\\x, {\\x - \\x^3/6})", "    node[below right, font=\\small, inner sep=1pt] {$T_3$};", "  \\draw[omDef, thick, dotted, smooth]", "    plot[domain=-3.25:3.25, samples=90]", "    (\\x, {\\x - \\x^3/6 + \\x^5/120})", "    node[above right, font=\\small, inner sep=1pt] {$T_5$};", "\\end{tikzpicture}", ""]}